\c 17
\s1 The Place of Sacrifice
\p \v 1 \rb Then the LORD|יְהוָ֖ה\rb* \rb said|וַיְדַבֵּ֥ר\rb* \rb to|אֶל־\rb* \rb Moses|מֹשֶׁ֥ה\rb*\rb |לֵּאמֹֽר׃\rb*, \v 2 “\rb Speak|דַּבֵּ֨ר\rb* \rb to|אֶֽל־\rb* \rb Aaron|אַהֲרֹ֜ן\rb*,\rb |וְאֶל־\rb* \rb his sons|בָּנָ֗יו\rb*,\rb |וְאֶל֙\rb* \rb and all|כָּל־\rb* \rb the Israelites|בְּנֵ֣י\rb*\rb |יִשְׂרָאֵ֔ל\rb* \rb and tell|וְאָמַרְתָּ֖\rb* \rb them|אֲלֵיהֶ֑ם\rb* \rb this|זֶ֣ה\rb*\rb |הַדָּבָ֔ר\rb* \rb is what|אֲשֶׁר־\rb* \rb the LORD|יְהוָ֖ה\rb*\rb |לֵאמֹֽר׃\rb* \rb has commanded|צִוָּ֥ה\rb*: \v 3 ‘\rb Anyone|אִ֥ישׁ\rb*\rb |אִישׁ֙\rb* \rb from the house|מִבֵּ֣ית\rb* \rb of Israel|יִשְׂרָאֵ֔ל\rb* \rb who|אֲשֶׁ֨ר\rb* \rb slaughters|יִשְׁחַ֜ט\rb* \rb an ox|שׁ֥וֹר\rb*,\f + \fr 17:3 \ft Or \fqa a bull \ft or \fqa a cow\f* \rb a lamb|כֶ֛שֶׂב\rb*, \rb or|אוֹ־\rb* \rb a goat|עֵ֖ז\rb* \rb in the camp|בַּֽמַּחֲנֶ֑ה\rb*\rb |א֚וֹ\rb*\rb |אֲשֶׁ֣ר\rb*\rb |אוֹ־\rb*\rb |יִשְׁחַ֔ט\rb* \rb or outside|מִח֖וּץ\rb* \rb of it|לַֽמַּחֲנֶֽה׃\rb* \v 4 \rb instead of|לֹ֣א\rb* \rb bringing|הֱבִיאוֹ֒\rb* \rb it to|וְאֶל־\rb* \rb the entrance|פֶּ֜תַח\rb* \rb to the Tent|אֹ֣הֶל\rb* \rb of Meeting|מוֹעֵד֮\rb* \rb to present|לְהַקְרִ֤יב\rb* \rb it as an offering|קָרְבָּן֙\rb* \rb to the LORD|לַֽיהוָ֔ה\rb* \rb before|לִפְנֵ֖י\rb* \rb His|יְהוָ֑ה\rb* \rb tabernacle|מִשְׁכַּ֣ן\rb*— \rb that|הַהוּא֙\rb* \rb man|לָאִ֤ישׁ\rb* \rb shall incur|יֵחָשֵׁ֞ב\rb* \rb bloodguilt|דָּ֣ם\rb*. \rb He has shed|שָׁפָ֔ךְ\rb* \rb blood|דָּ֣ם\rb* \rb and must be cut off|וְנִכְרַ֛ת\rb*\rb |הָאִ֥ישׁ\rb*\rb |הַה֖וּא\rb* \rb from among|מִקֶּ֥רֶב\rb* \rb his people|עַמּֽוֹ׃\rb*.
\p \v 5 \rb For this reason|לְמַעַן֩\rb*\rb |אֲשֶׁ֨ר\rb* \rb the Israelites|בְּנֵ֣י\rb*\rb |יִשְׂרָאֵ֗ל\rb*\rb |אֶֽת־\rb* \rb will bring|יָבִ֜יאוּ\rb* \rb to the LORD|לַֽיהוָ֗ה\rb* \rb the sacrifices|זִבְחֵיהֶם֮\rb*\rb |אֲשֶׁ֣ר\rb* \rb they|הֵ֣ם\rb* \rb have been offering|זֹבְחִים֮\rb* \rb in|עַל־\rb* \rb the open|פְּנֵ֣י\rb* \rb fields|הַשָּׂדֶה֒\rb*. \rb They are to bring them|וֶֽהֱבִיאֻ֣ם\rb* \rb to|אֶל־\rb* \rb the priest|הַכֹּהֵ֑ן\rb* \rb at|אֶל־\rb* \rb the entrance|פֶּ֛תַח\rb* \rb to the Tent|אֹ֥הֶל\rb* \rb of Meeting|מוֹעֵ֖ד\rb* \rb and offer|וְזָ֨בְח֜וּ\rb* \rb them|אוֹתָֽם׃\rb* \rb as sacrifices|זִבְחֵ֧י\rb* \rb of peace offerings|שְׁלָמִ֛ים\rb* \rb to the LORD|לַֽיהוָ֖ה\rb*. \v 6 \rb The priest|הַכֹּהֵ֤ן\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb will then splatter|וְזָרַ֨ק\rb* \rb the blood|הַדָּם֙\rb* \rb on|עַל־\rb* \rb the altar|מִזְבַּ֣ח\rb* \rb of the LORD|יְהוָ֔ה\rb* \rb at the entrance|פֶּ֖תַח\rb* \rb to the Tent|אֹ֣הֶל\rb* \rb of Meeting|מוֹעֵ֑ד\rb* \rb and burn|וְהִקְטִ֣יר\rb* \rb the fat|הַחֵ֔לֶב\rb* \rb as a pleasing|נִיחֹ֖חַ\rb* \rb aroma|לְרֵ֥יחַ\rb* \rb to the LORD|לַיהוָֽה׃\rb*.
\p \v 7 \rb They must no|וְלֹא־\rb* \rb longer|עוֹד֙\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb offer|יִזְבְּח֥וּ\rb* \rb their sacrifices|זִבְחֵיהֶ֔ם\rb* \rb to the goat demons|לַשְּׂעִירִ֕ם\rb*\f + \fr 17:7 \ft Or \fqa goat idols\f* \rb to which|אֲשֶׁ֛ר\rb* \rb they|הֵ֥ם\rb* \rb have prostituted|זֹנִ֖ים\rb* \rb themselves|אַחֲרֵיהֶ֑ם\rb*. \rb This|זֹּ֥את\rb* \rb will be|תִּֽהְיֶה־\rb* \rb a permanent|עוֹלָ֛ם\rb* \rb statute|חֻקַּ֥ת\rb* \rb for them|לָהֶ֖ם\rb* \rb for the generations to come|לְדֹרֹתָֽם׃\rb*.’
