\p \v 18 \rb If a man|וְ֠אִישׁ\rb*\rb |אֲשֶׁר־\rb* \rb lies|יִשְׁכַּ֨ב\rb* \rb with|אֶת־\rb* \rb a menstruating|דָּוָ֗ה\rb* \rb woman|אִשָּׁ֜ה\rb* \rb and has sexual relations with her|וְגִלָּ֤ה\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb*\rb |עֶרְוָתָהּ֙\rb*,\f + \fr 20:18 \ft Literally \fqa uncovers her nakedness\ft ; similarly in verse 19\f*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb he has exposed|הֶֽעֱרָ֔ה\rb* \rb the source of her flow|מְקֹרָ֣הּ\rb*, \rb and she|וְהִ֕יא\rb* \rb has uncovered|גִּלְּתָ֖ה\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb the source|מְק֣וֹר\rb* \rb of her blood|דָּמֶ֑יהָ\rb*. \rb Both|שְׁנֵיהֶ֖ם\rb* \rb of them must be cut off|וְנִכְרְת֥וּ\rb* \rb from among|מִקֶּ֥רֶב\rb* \rb their people|עַמָּֽם׃\rb*.
\p \v 19 \rb You must not|לֹ֣א\rb* \rb have sexual relations with|וְעֶרְוַ֨ת\rb*\rb |תְגַלֵּ֑ה\rb* \rb the sister|אֲח֧וֹת\rb* \rb of your mother|אִמְּךָ֛\rb* \rb or your father|אָבִ֖יךָ\rb*\rb |וַאֲח֥וֹת\rb*, \rb for|כִּ֧י\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb it is exposing|הֶעֱרָ֖ה\rb* \rb one’s own kin|שְׁאֵר֛וֹ\rb*; \rb both shall bear|יִשָּֽׂאוּ׃\rb* \rb their iniquity|עֲוֺנָ֥ם\rb*.
